ernity is and what  eternity does here's my issue if thor  and valkyrie both knew about eternity  and knew what eternity does why did they  not seek eternity after avengers  infinity war where thanos snapped away  half of the universe think about this  for a second in avengers infinity war  thor did not go for the head he drove  stormbreaker through thanos chest he did  this on purpose but this allowed thanos  to snap therefore thor kind of took the  blame on himself that's why he would  eventually go on to become brother but  in avengers in-game the avengers still  go seek thanos and they find him sadly  he has already destroyed all of the  stones and there's no way to get them  back so thor in his rage cuts off his  head and realizes that it's his fault  and there's nothing else he can do to  reverse it however there was something  he could do he could have gone to  eternity and asked eternity to reverse  the snap and bring everybody back at  that point thanos was already dead the  stones were already destroyed he could  have literally asked eternity to just  bring everybody back that was snapped  and thanos wouldn't have come back and  there wouldn't have been a five year gap  this is what i consider to be a big plot  hole at first but now i definitely think  that this is actually marvel studios  setting some things up in the future for  the cosmic entities now obviously of  course people are going to say well it's  the writing eternity wasn't even brought  to the equation until thor love and  thunder unless you believe that star  lord actually did see eternity and  guardians of the galaxy vol 2. but  besides that yeah eternity was not  brought into the equation until thor  love and thunder however in the mcu  there has to be some type of continuity  there has to be reason there has to be  logic so what is the real reason that  thor wouldn't have gone to eternity in  avengers in game well like i mentioned  at first i thought this could be a very  big plot hole but now i think it's  actually a huge setup for the future of  the mcu that could have some pretty big  consequences consequences that i would  personally love to see because i believe  that this is a major setup for the next  big avengers end game level movie secret  wars remember kevin feige said that  we're going to start to see all of this  come together soon and see which  direction the mcu was going he also said  that many fans could probably see where  it's going and all of us have seen  secret wars so when thor love and  thunder where gore asks eternity to  bring his daughter love back it does  appear like eternity is no more but is  in fact somewhat inside of love and now  obviously marvel studios changes things  from the comics in the comics eternity  is the actual embodiment of the universe  and eternity basically has unlimited  power however there is an eternity for  each universe so in the multiverse there  are separate eternities one for each  universe unlike the living tribunal that  exists everywhere all at once and in the  comics when thanos had the infinity  gauntlet he actually ranked eternity  right below the living tribunal so as  you can see eternity is a very powerful  entity and eternity typically only shows  up when there is a huge threat to the  universe in the comics this is when  dormammu threatens the entire universe  or thanos gets the infinity gauntlet and  the infinity gems and the heart of the  universe now you may be wondering well  why didn't eternity or any other cosmic  being for that matter step in when  thanos had the infinity gauntlet an  infinity war and end game well since  thanos only threatened half of the  universe this may have been kind of okay  with eternity and he might not have  thought it was a big enough reason to  step in for example in the comics  eternity is summoned by galactus and mr  fantastic in which eternity actually  made reed richard see that galactus was  a part of the natural order of the  universe so that could have been thanos  in the mcu and that could explain why  eternity never stepped in however it  looks like eternity is now gone and that  is very very different and very very bad  this is actually a big part of secret  wars in the comics this is how  incursions are actually able to happen  and why eternity can't step in to stop  our earth combining with other  universe's earths in secret wars  eternity of our earth as well as its  counterparts and other universes were  all eventually annihilated by the  beyonders so when incursions started to  happen eternity and its counterparts  were not there to stop it they were also  not there to stop dr doom this is how dr  doom was able to seize the power of the  beyonders and reshape several different  realities into battle world so as you  can see there are major repercussions to  eternity no longer being around in our  universe but let's say eternity is not  actually gone let's say that he granted  the wish and just simply went away this  has major repercussions as well because  it seemed like eternity was simply  resting he was meditating well now he is  kind of awakened and we know that the  cosmic entities are actually becoming  more and more important in the mcu and  in fact in thor love and thunder we saw  the gateway to other cosmic entities  like death the living tribunal the  watcher those were put there very  intentionally and even in doctor strange  in the multiverse of madness doctor  strange and america chavez seemingly go  into a universe where it's a bunch of  living tribunals however i actually  think that this was the living tribunal  watching what doctor strange was doing  seeing if he needed to step in also keep  in mind that all three heads of the  living tribunal have to agree with one  another before they actually step in so  that could be the reason that the living  tribunal is not stepping in with the  incursions yet but as i mentioned it  seems like eternity if he's not gone is  now somewhat awakened and this could be  a bad thing this could actually be a  reason why thor never went to him there  could have been a major side effect to  eternity granting a wish thor is  asgardian he's a god he's over 1500  years old and his father was the  all-powerful odin i'm sure his father  taught him about the cosmic entities and  who eternity was and since neither  valkyrie nor thor thought to go to  eternity right away but knew exactly who  eternity was and were scared of gore  reaching eternity in thor 11 thunder  perhaps they knew there would be major  repercussions of gore asking for a wish  not only would he probably ask for the  gods to be eliminated but it could be a  situation to where if eternity grants  the wish then eternity is gone if  eternity is gone much like in the comics  this could set up god emperor doom to  come to power this could also be how  incursions start to happen and nobody  steps in to intervene now of course  there is the living tribunal but i'm  expecting him to be addressed very soon  as well i believe that marvel studios is  actually building up to the cosmic  entities finally being involved in the  events of the universe and ultimately  the multiverse they are teasing us with  other gods they started in moon night  where they even mentioned that there are  different afterlife realms then they  teased us again in thor love and thunder  with all of the greek gods and zeus and  of course they finally introduced  eternity but there have been other  easter eggs as well like the staff of  the living tribunal and doctor strange  number one and how do you go bigger and  better than avengers in-game well adding  cosmic entities to the equation and then  removing them for all of the chaos and  secret wars to actually happen would be  fantastic and that's what i ultimately  think is happening here in thor love and  thunder i think there's going to be  major repercussions to what happened  with gore and making his wish this would  explain why thor never thought to go to  eternity after avengers infinity war  because if thor knew that he could grant  a wish it would make sense for him to at  least try even if he didn't exactly know  how to get to him it did seem very clear  that thor and valkyrie knew where the  gate was to him at the center of the  universe so even if they didn't know how  to unlock that gate or what the key was  as zeus says they still should have at  least tried giving it a shot but they  didn't eternity was never even mentioned  and while you could view this as one of  marvel's biggest plot holes ever i don't  think that's the case i think it's  actually setting something up for the  future for secret wars but let me know  what you think about this in the  comments down below do you have your own  theory about this or do you think  something really big is coming really  really soon let me know down below don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  so you don't miss out on any of the  latest mcu news or theories you can  always follow me on instagram and  twitter for live updates and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof

